<h2 id="connect-your-applications" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#connect-your-applications">Connect your applications</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h2>
<p>One deployment serves objects, tables, and files, each over its own native interface.</p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 @container"><div data-card="true" class="block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full"><h3 class="not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium"></h3><div class="text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden"><h4 id="objects-over-the-s3-api" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#objects-over-the-s3-api">Objects over the S3 API</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></h4><p><a href="/aistor/developers/s3-api-compatibility/">Use the S3 tools, SDKs, and libraries you already have</a></p></div></div><div data-card="true" class="block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full"><h3 class="not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium"></h3><div class="text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden"><h4 id="tables-over-the-iceberg-api" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#tables-over-the-iceberg-api">Tables over the Iceberg API</a><button aria-label="Copy Anchor Link" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font